  destinations:
  - destinationName: Buenos Aires Street District
    description: "Historic avenues blend culture and modern energy.  Colorful architecture
      lines lively neighborhood. streets Outdoor caf\xE9s buzz with conversation
      and music Elegant plazas invite visitors to explore and relax. The city's vibrant
      spirit shines at every turn."
    background: {fileID: -3325792785554865142, guid: d2e7491d605aa4a1d82979796623e356, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Pampas Countryside
    description: Endless grasslands stretch beneath wide blue skies. Gentle winds
      sweep across open countryside trails. Traditional ranches dot the peaceful
      landscape. Golden fields glow beneath the afternoon sun. Nature and heritage
      meet across the plains.
    background: {fileID: -1002932777974010920, guid: 2cdfb3a7c1c824c7184d1aa5adc32ebb, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Iguazu Falls
    description: Powerful waterfalls thunder through tropical rainforest. Mist rises
      high above cascading waters below. Lush greenery surrounds every viewing path.Rainbow
      reflections shimmer through the spray. A breathtaking natural wonder unfolds
      at every step.
    background: {fileID: 4262511610441398085, guid: 285e3ec3047694e159d55920ee4e5360, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Patagonia Glacier
    description: Towering glaciers sparkle beneath crisp mountain air.Frozen blue
      walls rise above tranquil waters. Snowy peaks frame the dramatic landscape.
      Ancient ice formations reveal nature's artistry. A sense of adventure fills
      the wilderness.
    background: {fileID: -6239705627998776764, guid: 81fb2fbc3711d4441bcdcd2826cd5c85, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Andean Village
    description: Stone pathways wind through mountain communities. Traditional homes
      overlook breathtaking valleys Snow-capped peaks dominate the distant horizon
      Local culture thrives among rugged landscapes. Every corner reflects timeless
      mountain life
    background: {fileID: 4258565511144527031, guid: 40410b625fb334485af3c02d493c24ae, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Bariloche Lakeside Town
    description: Crystal-clear lakes mirror surrounding forests and peaks. Wooden
      lodges create a cozy alpine atmosphere. Scenic walking paths hug the peaceful
      shoreline. Fresh mountain air fills every lakeside view. Natural beauty defines
      this charming retreat.
    background: {fileID: 2809389788163188187, guid: f0a890fbfe76c4a628b569e13063108a, type: 3}
